{"id":"architecture","title":"2. System Architecture","phase":null,"phaseName":null,"category":"Documentation","subcategory":"architecture","language":"markdown","description":"In-depth architecture diagram, components, and data flow of the co-located CAP Node.js and Python LangGraph system on SAP BTP.","sections":[],"content":"<h2>Main Architecture</h2><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 840\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <!-- Card Gradients (High Contrast, Deep Dark Luxury Palette) --> <linearGradient id=\"canvas-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0b0f19\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#111827\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"client-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1e293b\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0f172a\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"droplet-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f172a\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1e1b4b\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"node-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#042f2e\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"python-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#172554\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1e3a8a\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"dest-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#2a1205\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#431407\" /> </linearGradient> <!-- Model Priority Gradients --> <linearGradient id=\"p1-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#064e3b\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"p2-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0c4a6e\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"p3-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4c1d95\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#6d28d9\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"p4-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7c2d12\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ea580c\" /> </linearGradient> <!-- Drop Shadows --> <filter id=\"soft-shadow\" x=\"-5%\" y=\"-5%\" width=\"110%\" height=\"110%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"8\" stdDeviation=\"12\" flood-color=\"#000000\" flood-opacity=\"0.5\" /> </filter> <filter id=\"glow-teal\" x=\"-10%\" y=\"-10%\" width=\"120%\" height=\"120%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"0\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"#14b8a6\" flood-opacity=\"0.3\" /> </filter> <!-- Markers --> <marker id=\"arr-teal\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2dd4bf\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-amber\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" /> </marker> <style> .txt-title { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.02em; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-hdr { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-body { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; fill: #e2e8f0; } .txt-dim { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-code { font-family: 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: #38bdf8; } .txt-pill { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; } .flow-line { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.5s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } </style> </defs> <!-- Background Base Container --> <rect width=\"1280\" height=\"840\" fill=\"url(#canvas-bg)\" rx=\"18\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <!-- Diagram Title Header --> <text x=\"640\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-title\">SAP BTP Bookshop Multi-Buildpack — Enterprise AI Architecture</text> <text x=\"640\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Cloud Foundry 512 MB Droplet • CAP Edge Gateway • LangGraph Stateful Agent • HANA Vector Engine • 4-Destination Failover</text> <!-- ==================== COLUMN 1: CLIENT INGRESS (x: 30, w: 220) ==================== --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"220\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#client-grad)\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"190\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#64748b\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">🌐 Client Ingress Layer</text> <!-- Fiori UI Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">Fiori Elements UI</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">OData V4 Catalog</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" class=\"txt-code\">/browse/Books</text> </g> <!-- Single Turn AI Ask --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 152)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">Single-Turn AI Completion</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">Direct LLM Prompt</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask</text> </g> <!-- HANA Vector RAG --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 236)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#34d399\">HANA Vector RAG Search</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">REAL_VECTOR 1536</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask_rag</text> </g> <!-- LangGraph Stateful Agent --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 320)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c084fc\">Stateful Agent Workflow</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">Reasoning &amp; Memory</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask_agent</text> </g> <!-- SSE Real-time Streaming --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 404)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fb923c\">Server-Sent Events (SSE)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">Real-time Token Stream</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" class=\"txt-code\">POST /ai/ask/stream</text> </g> <!-- Health & Ready Probes --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 488)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">System Probes</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">Liveness &amp; IPC Readiness</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"60\" class=\"txt-code\">/healthz • /readyz</text> </g> <!-- Ingress Security Controls --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 572)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"125\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#022c22\" stroke=\"#059669\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#6ee7b7\">🔒 Ingress Security</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Rate Limiter: 15 req/min</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"68\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Helmet &amp; CORS Policies</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"88\" class=\"txt-dim\">• XSUAA JWT Verification</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"108\" class=\"txt-code\">429 on abuse / 401 on unauth</text> </g> </g> <!-- ==================== COLUMN 2: SAP BTP CF CONTAINER DROPLET (x: 275, w: 680) ==================== --> <g transform=\"translate(275, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"680\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#droplet-grad)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"16\" /> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"16\" width=\"640\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"340\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">📦 SAP BTP Cloud Foundry Container Droplet (512 MB Single-Tenant Pod)</text> <!-- Node.js CAP Edge Gateway --> <g transform=\"translate(20, 60)\"> <rect width=\"640\" height=\"165\" fill=\"url(#node-grad)\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"12\" filter=\"url(#glow-teal)\" /> <text x=\"320\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">⚡ Node.js CAP Edge Gateway (@sap/cds v10 + Express Engine)</text> <!-- CAP Subcard 1 --> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"42\" width=\"195\" height=\"108\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"25\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">OData V4 Core</text> <text x=\"25\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Books &amp; Authors Catalog</text> <text x=\"25\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Orders &amp; Stock Updates</text> <text x=\"25\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-dim\">• ML discount() Handler</text> <text x=\"25\" y=\"140\" class=\"txt-code\">/browse/discount()</text> <!-- CAP Subcard 2 --> <rect x=\"222\" y=\"42\" width=\"195\" height=\"108\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"232\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Auto-Destination Select</text> <text x=\"232\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">• @sap-cloud-sdk/conn</text> <text x=\"232\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Auto-resolves BTP binding</text> <text x=\"232\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Zero hardcoded secrets</text> <text x=\"232\" y=\"140\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/ai-destination.js</text> <!-- CAP Subcard 3 --> <rect x=\"430\" y=\"42\" width=\"195\" height=\"108\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" /> <text x=\"440\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">IPC Controller</text> <text x=\"440\" y=\"86\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Spawns Python lazily</text> <text x=\"440\" y=\"104\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Newline JSON-RPC</text> <text x=\"440\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-dim\">• 0ms per-call cold start</text> <text x=\"440\" y=\"140\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/python.js Bridge</text> </g> <!-- IPC Bridge Banner Connector --> <g transform=\"translate(180, 235)\"> <rect width=\"320\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"160\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">⇄ stdin / stdout JSON-RPC IPC Channel ⇄</text> </g> <path d=\"M 340,225 L 340,235\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <path d=\"M 340,265 L 340,275\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <!-- Co-located Python ML Worker --> <g transform=\"translate(20, 275)\"> <rect width=\"640\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#python-grad)\" stroke=\"#60a5fa\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"12\" /> <text x=\"320\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">🐍 Co-located Python ML Worker (LangChain + LangGraph + Defense-in-Depth Guardrails)</text> <!-- Python Subsystem 1: Defense-in-Depth Guardrails --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 42)\"> <rect width=\"295\" height=\"92\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">🛡️ Defense-in-Depth Input Guardrails</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Direct/Indirect prompt injection scanner</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Secret &amp; PII auto-redaction (regex filter)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"80\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/guardrails.py</text> </g> <!-- Python Subsystem 2: Redis Prompt Cache --> <g transform=\"translate(330, 42)\"> <rect width=\"295\" height=\"92\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">⚡ Enterprise Redis Prompt Cache</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">• SHA-256 (model:prompt) key signature</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-dim\">• &lt; 5ms cached response hit time (1h TTL)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"80\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/cache.py</text> </g> <!-- Python Subsystem 3: LangGraph Stateful Agent --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 146)\"> <rect width=\"295\" height=\"105\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a78bfa\">🧠 LangGraph Stateful Agent</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">• StateGraph pipeline with multi-turn memory</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Tool nodes: Stock check &amp; discount math</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"80\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Context compression (50%+ token savings)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"98\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/graph.py</text> </g> <!-- Python Subsystem 4: HANA Vector Engine --> <g transform=\"translate(330, 146)\"> <rect width=\"295\" height=\"105\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#34d399\">📐 SAP HANA Cloud Vector RAG</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Native REAL_VECTOR(1536) embeddings</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-dim\">• COSINE_SIMILARITY() catalog search</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"80\" class=\"txt-dim\">• HanaDB LangChain VectorStore</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"98\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/rag.py</text> </g> <!-- Python Subsystem 5: Multi-Model Router & Failover --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 262)\"> <rect width=\"610\" height=\"142\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"20\" y=\"26\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbbf24\">🔄 Multi-Model Router &amp; Failover Cascade Engine (python/agent/llm_router.py)</text> <!-- Failover visual pills --> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"42\" width=\"135\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#064e3b\" stroke=\"#34d399\" /> <text x=\"87\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-pill\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">1. DiffusionGemma</text> <text x=\"87\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Priority 1 Primary</text> <text x=\"165\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">➔</text> <rect x=\"180\" y=\"42\" width=\"125\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0c4a6e\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"242\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-pill\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">2. Gemma 4 31B</text> <text x=\"242\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Priority 2 (P2)</text> <text x=\"315\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">➔</text> <rect x=\"330\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#4c1d95\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"387\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-pill\" fill=\"#e9d5ff\">3. GLM 5.2</text> <text x=\"387\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Priority 3</text> <text x=\"455\" y=\"66\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">➔</text> <rect x=\"470\" y=\"42\" width=\"125\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#7c2d12\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"532\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-pill\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">4. Mistral</text> <text x=\"532\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Fallback Model</text> <!-- Subtext details --> <text x=\"20\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Exponential Backoff: 1s ➔ 2s ➔ 4s retries on transient errors / rate limits</text> <text x=\"20\" y=\"125\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Output Guardrails: Competitor name redaction &amp; response groundedness validator</text> </g> </g> </g> <!-- ==================== COLUMN 3: BTP DESTINATIONS & BACKENDS (x: 980, w: 270) ==================== --> <g transform=\"translate(980, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"270\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#dest-grad)\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"240\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#431407\" stroke=\"#f97316\" /> <text x=\"135\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">☁️ BTP Destinations &amp; AI Models</text> <!-- Priority 1 Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"85\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#p1-grad)\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">🥇 Priority 1 (Primary)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-body\">google-diffusiongemma</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#6ee7b7\">google/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"78\" class=\"txt-dim\">NVIDIA Foundation Endpoint</text> </g> <!-- Priority 2 Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 163)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"85\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#p2-grad)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">🥈 Priority 2 (P2)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-body\">google-gemma-4-31b-it</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\">google/gemma-4-31b-it</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"78\" class=\"txt-dim\">NVIDIA Foundation Endpoint</text> </g> <!-- Priority 3 Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 258)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"85\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#p3-grad)\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#e9d5ff\">🥉 Priority 3</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-body\">z-ai-glm-5-2</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#d8b4fe\">z-ai/glm-5.2</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"78\" class=\"txt-dim\">NVIDIA Foundation Endpoint</text> </g> <!-- Priority 4 Fallback Model Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 353)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"85\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#p4-grad)\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">🛡️ Priority 4 (Fallback)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"44\" class=\"txt-body\">mistralai-mistral-nemotron</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#fdba74\">mistralai/mistral-nemotron</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"78\" class=\"txt-dim\">Designated Fallback Target</text> </g> <!-- Managed Backends Card --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 450)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"247\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1e1b4b\" stroke=\"#818cf8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c7d2fe\">SAP BTP Managed Backends</text> <g transform=\"translate(12, 40)\"> <text x=\"0\" y=\"16\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a5b4fc\">🔑 SAP XSUAA</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"32\" class=\"txt-dim\">JWT Authentication &amp; Scopes</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"62\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a5b4fc\">⚡ SAP BTP Redis Instance</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"78\" class=\"txt-dim\">&lt; 5ms Completions Prompt Cache</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"108\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a5b4fc\">🗄️ SAP HANA Cloud</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"124\" class=\"txt-dim\">HDI Container &amp; REAL_VECTOR Table</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"154\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a5b4fc\">📊 LangSmith Observability</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"170\" class=\"txt-dim\">Tracing, Tokens &amp; Latency Profiling</text> <text x=\"0\" y=\"196\" class=\"txt-code\" fill=\"#818cf8\">VCAP_SERVICES Dynamic Bindings</text> </g> </g> </g> <!-- Connectors --> <path d=\"M 250,220 L 275,220\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-teal)\" /> <path d=\"M 955,420 L 980,420\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-amber)\" /></svg></div><p>The <strong>BookShop Multi-Buildpack</strong> application is an SAP BTP Cloud Foundry enterprise pattern built with SAP CAP (<code>@sap/cds</code>). It seamlessly combines a <strong>Node.js runtime</strong> (accepting OData V4 client requests) with a <strong>co-located Python process</strong> running a stateful <strong>LangGraph AI Agent</strong>, <strong>LangChain Chains</strong>, <strong>Enterprise Redis Prompt Cache</strong>, and an <strong>SAP HANA Cloud REAL_VECTOR RAG Engine</strong>.</p><h3>Component & Process Flow</h3><p>1. <strong>Client Request</strong>: Clients connect to CAP OData V4 endpoints (<code>/browse</code>), AI endpoints (<code>/ai/ask</code>, <code>/ai/ask_rag</code>, <code>/ai/ask_agent</code>, <code>/ai/ask/stream</code>), or Fiori Elements UI.<br>2. <strong>Node.js CAP Server (<code>@sap/cds</code>)</strong>:<br>   - Handles entity persistence, OData V4 routing, and XSUAA authentication.<br>   - Enforces sliding-window rate limiting (15 req/min) and security headers.<br>   - Auto-discovers BTP Destinations via <code>@sap-cloud-sdk/connectivity</code> (<code>google-diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it</code>, <code>google-gemma-4-31b-it</code>, <code>z-ai-glm-5-2</code>, <code>mistralai-mistral-nemotron</code>) without hardcoded keys or secret URLs.<br>3. <strong>Python Worker Bridge (<code>python/functions.py --worker</code>)</strong>:<br>   - A single, persistent Python process spawned lazily on startup by <code>srv/python.js</code>.<br>   - Communicates with Node.js via newline-delimited JSON-RPC over <code>stdin</code>/<code>stdout</code> (0ms per-request cold start).<br>4. <strong>LangChain & LangGraph Stateful Agent Pipeline</strong>:<br>   - <strong>Input Guardrails</strong>: Scans for prompt injection attacks and redacts PII/secrets.<br>   - <strong>Enterprise Redis Prompt Cache</strong>: Checks <code>redis-instance</code> for cached completions (< 5ms response time).<br>   - <strong>SAP HANA Cloud REAL_VECTOR Search</strong>: Performs 1536-dim vector similarity search over book embeddings.<br>   - <strong>Multi-Model Router</strong>: Executes failover cascade across BTP destinations:<br>      <div class=\"failover-cascade\">\n        <span class=\"fc-step p1\">P1 · google/diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it</span>\n        <span class=\"fc-arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"fc-step p2\">P2 · google/gemma-4-31b-it</span>\n        <span class=\"fc-arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"fc-step p3\">P3 · z-ai/glm-5.2</span>\n        <span class=\"fc-arrow\">→</span>\n        <span class=\"fc-step fallback\">Fallback · mistralai/mistral-nemotron</span>\n      </div><br>   - <strong>Output Guardrails</strong>: Redacts competitor names and validates response groundedness.</p><h3>Component Responsibilities</h3><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Technology</th><th>Responsibility</th><th>Communication</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Node.js CAP Gateway</strong></td><td>&lt;code&gt;@sap/cds&lt;/code&gt; v10 / Express</td><td>OData V4 API (&lt;code&gt;/browse&lt;/code&gt;), Rate limiting, Auto-Destination resolution, SSE streaming (&lt;code&gt;/ai/ask/stream&lt;/code&gt;)</td><td>&lt;code&gt;http&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;$PORT&lt;/code&gt;</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Python ML &amp; AI Worker</strong></td><td>Python 3 / LangChain / LangGraph</td><td>Input/Output Guardrails, Redis Cache, SAP HANA Vector RAG, Stateful Agent Workflow, Failover LLM Routing</td><td>&lt;code&gt;stdin&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;stdout&lt;/code&gt; JSON-RPC bridge</td></tr><tr><td><strong>SAP BTP Services</strong></td><td>XSUAA, Destination, Redis, SAP HANA Cloud</td><td>Auth JWT validation, Destination key lookup, Prompt cache (&lt; 5ms), &lt;code&gt;REAL_VECTOR(1536)&lt;/code&gt; storage</td><td>SAP BTP Service Bindings</td></tr></tbody></table></div><br><h2>Security Boundaries</h2><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 840\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"canvas-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0b0f19\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#111827\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"sec-public\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#831843\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#500724\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"sec-gateway\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#042f2e\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"sec-internal\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1e3a8a\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0f172a\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"sec-ai\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4c1d95\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1e1b4b\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"sec-backend\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7c2d12\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#431407\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"soft-shadow\" x=\"-5%\" y=\"-5%\" width=\"110%\" height=\"110%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"8\" stdDeviation=\"12\" flood-color=\"#000000\" flood-opacity=\"0.5\" /> </filter> <marker id=\"arr-pink\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#f472b6\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-teal\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2dd4bf\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-purple\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#c084fc\" /> </marker> <style> .txt-title { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-hdr { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-body { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; fill: #e2e8f0; } .txt-dim { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-code { font-family: 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: #38bdf8; } .flow-line { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.5s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } </style> </defs> <!-- Background Base Container --> <rect width=\"1280\" height=\"840\" fill=\"url(#canvas-bg)\" rx=\"18\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <!-- Diagram Title Header --> <text x=\"640\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-title\">Enterprise Security Boundaries &amp; Defense-in-Depth Architecture</text> <text x=\"640\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Public Ingress Security • Process Isolation • AI Defense Guardrails • Destination Credential Encapsulation</text> <!-- Top 5 Boundary Cards (Spaciously arranged across width 1280) --> <!-- 1. Public Ingress --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"225\" height=\"270\" fill=\"url(#sec-public)\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"195\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"112\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\">1. Public Ingress</text> <text x=\"112\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Cloud Foundry Gorouter</text> <g transform=\"translate(15, 80)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\">TLS 1.3 Termination</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">Strict HTTPS only on port 443</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 136)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\">DDoS / Firewall Filter</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">CF Ingress Edge Protection</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 192)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"55\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\">Internal Port Forward</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"42\" class=\"txt-code\">Port 443 ➔ Droplet $PORT</text> </g> </g> <!-- 2. Node.js Edge Gateway --> <g transform=\"translate(280, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"225\" height=\"270\" fill=\"url(#sec-gateway)\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"195\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" /> <text x=\"112\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#99f6e4\">2. Node.js Gateway</text> <text x=\"112\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Public Facing App Process</text> <g transform=\"translate(15, 80)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Sliding Rate Limiter</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">15 req/min per client IP</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 136)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">Helmet &amp; CORS</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">Strict origin headers &amp; CSP</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 192)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"55\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#042f2e\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#5eead4\">XSUAA JWT Validation</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"42\" class=\"txt-code\">Bearer token auth checks</text> </g> </g> <!-- 3. Python Subprocess Isolation --> <g transform=\"translate(530, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"225\" height=\"270\" fill=\"url(#sec-internal)\" stroke=\"#60a5fa\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"195\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"112\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">3. Python Subprocess</text> <text x=\"112\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Internal Zero-Port Worker</text> <g transform=\"translate(15, 80)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">Zero Network Sockets</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">No open TCP/UDP listening ports</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 136)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">stdin/stdout Pipe Only</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">Encapsulated child process IPC</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 192)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"55\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#67e8f9\">Memory Isolation</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"42\" class=\"txt-code\">Protected ML &amp; AI worker</text> </g> </g> <!-- 4. AI Defense Guardrails --> <g transform=\"translate(780, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"225\" height=\"270\" fill=\"url(#sec-ai)\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"195\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e1b4b\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" /> <text x=\"112\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#e9d5ff\">4. AI Defense-in-Depth</text> <text x=\"112\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Defense-in-Depth Suite</text> <g transform=\"translate(15, 80)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#d8b4fe\">Prompt Injection Defense</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">Jailbreak / DAN attack filter</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 136)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#d8b4fe\">PII / Secret Redaction</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">Auto-scrubs keys, emails, cards</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 192)\"> <rect width=\"195\" height=\"55\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#d8b4fe\">Groundedness Validator</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"42\" class=\"txt-code\">Filters competitor brands</text> </g> </g> <!-- 5. Protected BTP Backends --> <g transform=\"translate(1030, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"220\" height=\"270\" fill=\"url(#sec-backend)\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"190\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#431407\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">5. BTP Backends</text> <text x=\"110\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-dim\">Encapsulated Cloud Services</text> <g transform=\"translate(15, 80)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">Destination Service</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">No hardcoded API credentials</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 136)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">HANA Cloud TLS</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"38\" class=\"txt-dim\">Encrypted VECTOR table queries</text> </g> <g transform=\"translate(15, 192)\"> <rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">Redis Instance TLS</text> <text x=\"12\" y=\"42\" class=\"txt-code\">Encrypted prompt cache</text> </g> </g> <!-- Connectors Between Top Cards --> <path d=\"M 255,210 L 280,210\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-pink)\" /> <path d=\"M 505,210 L 530,210\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-teal)\" /> <path d=\"M 755,210 L 780,210\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <path d=\"M 1005,210 L 1030,210\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"flow-line\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-purple)\" /> <!-- Security Audit & Mitigation Matrix Table (Bottom, w: 1220) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 395)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"1220\" height=\"415\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"16\" /> <rect width=\"1220\" height=\"46\" fill=\"#0f172a\" rx=\"16\" /> <text x=\"610\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">Security Controls &amp; Threat Mitigation Matrix</text> <!-- Table Header Row --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Boundary Layer</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Primary Defense Mechanism</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Mitigated Risk / Threat Vector</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Enforcement Point</text> <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"1190\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\" /> <!-- Row 1 --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#f472b6\">1. Public Ingress</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-dim\">TLS 1.3 HTTPS Termination + Gorouter filtering</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-dim\">Man-in-the-Middle (MITM) &amp; Packet Tampering</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"122\" class=\"txt-code\">CF Gorouter Edge</text> <!-- Row 2 --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"172\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#2dd4bf\">2. Node.js Gateway</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"172\" class=\"txt-dim\">XSUAA JWT Validation + Sliding Rate Limiter (15 req/min)</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"172\" class=\"txt-dim\">Unauthorized Access, Denial of Service (DoS), &amp; CSRF</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"172\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/server.js Middleware</text> <!-- Row 3 --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"222\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">3. Python Worker</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"222\" class=\"txt-dim\">No open TCP sockets; stdin/stdout JSON-RPC pipe</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"222\" class=\"txt-dim\">Direct Remote Code Execution &amp; External Port Scans</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"222\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/python.js Subprocess</text> <!-- Row 4 --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"272\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c084fc\">4. AI Guardrails</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"272\" class=\"txt-dim\">Signature detection + Regex Secret &amp; PII Scrubbing</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"272\" class=\"txt-dim\">Jailbreaks, DAN Attacks, Token Leakage, Hallucination</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"272\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/guardrails.py</text> <!-- Row 5 --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"322\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fb923c\">5. BTP Backends</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"322\" class=\"txt-dim\">Dynamic Destination Service auto-resolution</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"322\" class=\"txt-dim\">Hardcoded Credentials &amp; API Key Leaks in Git Repos</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"322\" class=\"txt-code\">srv/ai-destination.js</text> <!-- Row 6 --> <text x=\"45\" y=\"372\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">6. Redis Cache</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"372\" class=\"txt-dim\">SHA-256 hashed keys + TLS encrypted VCAP binding</text> <text x=\"650\" y=\"372\" class=\"txt-dim\">Cache Poisoning &amp; Unauthenticated Memory Snooping</text> <text x=\"1010\" y=\"372\" class=\"txt-code\">python/agent/cache.py</text> </g></svg></div><ul><li><strong>Authentication</strong>: User authentication is enforced via SAP BTP XSUAA JWT validation.</li><br><li><strong>Service Isolation</strong>: The Python process is co-located in the container and isolated from external networks; only the Node.js CAP server exposes external HTTP ports.</li><br><li><strong>Anthropic Defense-in-Depth Guardrails</strong>: Direct/indirect prompt injection defense, secret/PII redactor, XML tag prompt isolation, and competitor filtering.</li><br></ul>","tags":["architecture","sap-btp","multi-buildpack","cap","nodejs","python"],"details":""}